meta {
  name: List Branch OPD Tests By Branch
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/branch-opd-tests/by-branch?branchId={{branchId}}&page=1&limit=20
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  branchId: {{branchId}}
  page: 1
  limit: 20
  ~search: Vitamin
  ~status: ACTIVE
  ~listId: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  OPD equivalent of the branch opd-test list, but reads a specific branch (GET /branch-opd-tests/by-branch?branchId=…) instead of the JWT's active branch — used by business-admin views that pick a branch explicitly.
  
  List the active branch's Lab Test List (paginated). Optional `search`
  (case-insensitive on testName/testCode), `status` (ACTIVE | INACTIVE), and
  `listId` (which pricing-list tab; omitted = the branch's default Walk-in list).
  Each row carries a `listPrice` (the effective selling price for its list).
  Scoped to the JWT tenant + active branch; soft-deleted rows are excluded.
}
